---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const colours = [
  { name: 'Warm off-white', hex: '#F7F6F2', role: 'Main page background', dark: false },
  { name: 'Near-black', hex: '#202020', role: 'Main text, buttons, thin frames', dark: true },
  { name: 'Yellow', hex: '#F4C430', role: 'Accent for lines, blocks, buttons and AUSTRALIA in the logo. Never for running text on light backgrounds.', dark: false },
  { name: 'Gold text', hex: '#A07810', role: 'Yellow for large text on off-white (3.7:1). Headline accent.', dark: true },
  { name: 'Gold small', hex: '#8F6B0E', role: 'Yellow for small text on off-white (4.5:1).', dark: true },
  { name: 'Medium grey', hex: '#686868', role: 'Supporting copy (5.2:1)', dark: true },
  { name: 'Warm light grey', hex: '#D7D4CD', role: 'Borders, separators', dark: false },
];
const logos = [
  ['vcace-logo-primary.svg', 'Full lock-up', '#F7F6F2'],
  ['vcace-logo-inverse-white.svg', 'Inverse (white)', '#202020'],
  ['vcace-logo-on-yellow.svg', 'On yellow', '#F4C430'],
  ['vcace-logo-compact.svg', 'Short lock-up', '#F7F6F2'],
  ['vcace-icon.svg', 'Icon / favicon', '#F7F6F2'],
];
---
<Base meta={{ title: 'Style guide | VCACE', description: 'VCACE visual identity reference.' }} noindex>
  <article class="doc sg">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Style guide</h1>
      <p class="lead">Reference for anyone producing VCACE materials. Source files are in the brand folder of the project.</p>

      <section>
        <h2>Logo</h2>
        <p>Use the boxed serif V with “VCACE”. Do not use a lotus or other traditional motif, and do not substitute “VA”. Keep clear space around the logo equal to the height of the V box ÷ 4 on every side. The short lock-up is the boxed V with VCACE and AUSTRALIA (yellow) underneath, both the same width, together as tall as the box. The full lock-up adds the tagline in grey underneath, running from the edge of the box to the end of the E. Minimum width of the full lock-up: 220 px on screen, 50 mm in print; below that, use the short lock-up or the icon.</p>
        <div class="sg-logos">
          {logos.map(([file, label, bg]) => (
            <figure style={`background:${bg}`}>
              <img src={`/brand/${file}`} alt={`VCACE ${label} logo`} loading="lazy" />
              <figcaption>{label} · <a href={`/brand/${file}`} download>SVG</a></figcaption>
            </figure>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="muted">Text in these files uses Helvetica Neue / Arial. A designer should convert text to outlines for final print artwork.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Colour</h2>
        <p>Yellow, near-black and warm off-white. No blue. Yellow is a single confident accent, not a background for long text.</p>
        <ul class="sg-colours">
          {colours.map((c) => (
            <li><span class="chip" style={`background:${c.hex}`}></span><div><b>{c.name}</b> <code>{c.hex}</code><p class="muted">{c.role}</p></div></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Typography</h2>
        <p>Helvetica Neue (Light 300, Regular 400), falling back to Helvetica, Arial and system sans-serif. Use a licensed webfont only if legally available.</p>
        <p class="sg-hero">Connecting cultures.</p>
        <p class="muted">Hero: 38–48 px mobile, 58–74 px desktop, weight 300–400, line-height 1.04–1.12.</p>
        <p style="font-size:18px">Body: 16–17 px mobile, 17–19 px desktop, line-height 1.5–1.65.</p>
        <p class="micro" style="margin-top:12px">Microcopy 11–13 px uppercase, wider spacing</p>
        <p class="muted">Avoid all caps in body text.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Photography</h2>
        <p>Real contemporary cultural activity in both countries: exhibitions, rehearsals, intimate dialogue, workshops, food and craft, heritage places. Vary the setting and discipline; keep light warm and neutral. Get written consent from identifiable people, with extra safeguards for children. Label concept or generated imagery as such, and record every licence and credit.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Buttons and links</h2>
        <div class="btns" style="margin-top:8px"><a class="btn primary" href="#">Primary action</a><a class="btn" href="#">Secondary action</a></div>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:16px">Button text says exactly what happens: “Start a conversation”, not “Submit”.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .sg-logos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:16px;margin:24px 0 16px}
  .sg-logos figure{margin:0;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;gap:16px}
  .sg-logos img{height:64px;width:auto;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;justify-self:start}
  .sg-logos figcaption{font-size:13px;font-weight:400;background:var(--bg);padding:4px 8px;justify-self:start}
  .sg-colours{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-top:20px;display:grid;gap:14px}
  .sg-colours li{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start}
  .chip{width:56px;height:56px;flex:none;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .sg-colours code{font-size:14px;color:var(--grey)}
  .sg-colours p{font-size:15px}
  .sg-hero{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,64px);line-height:1.08;margin:20px 0 8px}
</style>
